cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QECLean in your research, please cite the paper below, and the
  version of the library you used.
title: "QECLean: a Lean 4 formalization of the stabilizer formalism"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 / mathlib library formalizing stabilizer quantum error-correcting
  codes: the Pauli group and its binary-symplectic representation, stabilizer
  codes and their logical operators and distance, homological (CSS) codes, and
  concrete code families with kernel-checked distance proofs.
type: software
authors:
